## PR Tracking (Active Monitoring)

The Conductor must track all PRs throughout the day:

```bash
# Check all open PRs
echo "=== Open PRs ==="
gh pr list --state open --json number,title,author,createdAt

# Check recently merged PRs
echo "=== Merged Today ==="
gh pr list --state merged --search "merged:>=$(date -I)" --json number,title,author,mergedAt

# Check PR status for each agent
for agent in "product-strategist" "creative-director" "ux-architect" "tech-lead" "backend" "frontend"; do
    echo "Checking $agent PRs..."
    gh pr list --author "$agent" --state all --search "created:>=$(date -I)" --json number,state,merged
 done
```

